---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Mental Performance Training for Athletes';
const description = 'Mental performance training for athletes, including body awareness, breathing, reflection, confidence and behavior change.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Mental Performance</div><h1>Mental performance training for athletes.</h1><p class="lead">Mental performance training helps athletes understand their body, regulate stress, build focus and create habits that support better performance.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article>

<h2>What mental performance training includes</h2><p>Mental performance is not only motivation. It includes awareness, attention, confidence, emotional regulation, reflection and routines that help athletes respond well under pressure.</p><h2>Simple tools that work</h2><ul><li>Body scans to build awareness.</li><li>Diaphragmatic breathing to support calm and focus.</li><li>Reflection prompts to understand patterns and progress.</li><li>Pre-training routines to prepare mentally and physically.</li><li>Post-training check-ins to reinforce learning.</li></ul><h2>Why this matters for everyday athletes</h2><p>Anyone trying to train consistently benefits from mental skills. Stress, self-talk, confidence and behavior change all influence whether someone sticks with a program.</p><h2>Content opportunity</h2><p>This page can become a strong authority asset because it connects sports psychology, body awareness, training consistency and app-based guidance.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Content angle:</strong> This page should connect the topic back to the app naturally. Mention guided training, body care, nutrition education and mental performance where relevant without forcing a sales pitch.</div>
</article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
